    q1: ['What is the difference between COLLSCAN and IXSCAN in MongoDB explain()?', 'COLLSCAN scans every document in the collection (O(n), slow on large data), while IXSCAN uses a B-Tree index to jump directly to matching documents (O(log n), fast).'],
